hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"63","[AI-translation] Talhah bin Ubaidullah ki aulad mein se ek se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) ke paas tha, phir Abu Burdah bin Abi Musa un ke paas aaye, phir unhon ne unhen apne walid se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ahadees bayan kin. To Umar ne kagaz aur dawat mangwai, phir un ki ahadees likh lin. Un mein ek hadees thi jo unhon ne bayan ki. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne walid ko bayan karte hue suna, kehte the: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: 'Meri ummat rehem ki gayi ummat hai; us ka azab duniya mein rakha gaya. Phir jab qayamat ka din hoga, dosre deenon walon ko laya jayega, phir har shakhs ko ek [mard] diya jayega, phir kaha jayega: Ye jahannam se tumhara fidya hai.'"
